use firn/tags

rebuild-nopasswd is a Module
rebuild-nopasswd is tagged cli-tools

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.rebuild-nopasswd.enable
    "security"
      "sudo"
        "wheelNeedsPassword": false
  option "myConfig"."modules"."rebuild-nopasswd"."enable": enable "Passwordless sudo for nixos-rebuild (agent-autonomous firn rebuild)"
